# --- The single most important correction (report §0) ------------------------
# There are THREE donor shader systems, all recovered verbatim:
#   DEV     water.lib:67-68 pins water.dev.vert + water.dev.frag. Live colours
#           (0.1,0.24,0.24)/(0,0.025,0.05), coast fade 0.57, deep fade 1.07,
#           dry result fragColor=vec4(0.0) (NO grey hmap texel fallback).
#   BUILTIN C string literals inside cossacks.exe compiled by FUN_00855b38;
#           deepColor=(0,0,0.1255)/shallowColor=(0,0,0) from water.lib,
#           alphaDepth=gl_Color.r, 2-wave displacement.
#   LEGACY  water.vert + water.frag (NOT pinned by water.lib): colours
#           (0.43,0.60,0.66)/(0.06,0.07,0.11), fade 0.10, WATER_LEVEL 1.5,
#           discard keeps the RAW hmapTex texel -> THE GREY FALLBACK PATH.
# Which path is live at runtime is still [U] (report §11 U1). DEC_U_water_runtime.md
# §4.3 narrows it to [D]: shipped water.lib CustomEnable=False leaves C+0x184=0 on
# both construction paths (ev_2eb0…/ev_227e…, ev_5aae…, ev_513e…), so the CUSTOM arm
# of FUN_00856530 is unreachable and the embedded pair compiled by FUN_00855b38 is
