# stats["shader_path_unresolved"]. All three paths stay exposed as labelled mode
# switches with donor-literal values (§11 rule c). IMPL-WATER-SHADER hard scope: the
# single shipped water3d.gdshader now implements ALL THREE literal paths and
# this script binds each one by the exact donor uniform names (§4.3) behind the
# 0x3FFFFFFF enable mask; DEV equations were left untouched. A variant is drawn
# only when its required bindings exist: BUILTIN needs a real reflectionMap
# ([U12]; no FBO provenance is recoverable statically) and LEGACY needs the
# real hmapTex ([U3]; the decoded grid is a labelled substitute). Missing data
